    "detailed_description": "<strong>Ominous.Ritual.Metamorphosis</strong><br><br><i>Step into a survival horror game inspired by titles from the golden age of the genre</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441160/extras/6b98d4d68f989cd5e426cffc30aa6199.avif?t=1704007782\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 About the Game</strong></h2>If you one day receive a mysterious package from the Collector, then you've got to deliver it to its next intended victim or you will be trapped in his nightmarish world forever.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441160/extras/05e996b4f5c3f3f8d7291146b007164d.poster.avif?t=1704007782\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441160/extras/05e996b4f5c3f3f8d7291146b007164d.webm?t=1704007782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441160/extras/05e996b4f5c3f3f8d7291146b007164d.mp4?t=1704007782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Armed solely with a magical flashlight fueled by the ambient light of your surroundings,  you must fend off the encroaching darkness and its horrors at every turn <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441160/extras/449ee2c96cd753c98faaf2fb03e4e446.poster.avif?t=1704007782\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441160/extras/449ee2c96cd753c98faaf2fb03e4e446.webm?t=1704007782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441160/extras/449ee2c96cd753c98faaf2fb03e4e446.mp4?t=1704007782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Will you be able survive and break the curse, or succumb to becoming another prized possession in the Collector's macabre collection?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441160/extras/148cb66633ea242235317aa312642acb.poster.avif?t=1704007782\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441160/extras/148cb66633ea242235317aa312642acb.webm?t=1704007782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441160/extras/148cb66633ea242235317aa312642acb.mp4?t=1704007782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\u25a0 Explore several areas, inspired by real world locations in Taiwan<br><br>\u25a0 Engage in puzzle-solving and inventory management to overcome challenges.<br><br>\u25a0 Fight against enemies, wielding the power of light as your only defense.<br><br>\u25a0 Experience multiple endings and unlockable content as you strive for survival.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441160/extras/b990b19c2f41cbc663efc47c32cae3fa.poster.avif?t=1704007782\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441160/extras/b990b19c2f41cbc663efc47c32cae3fa.webm?t=1704007782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441160/extras/b990b19c2f41cbc663efc47c32cae3fa.mp4?t=1704007782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Ominous.Ritual.Metamorphosis</strong><br><br><i>Step into a survival horror game inspired by titles from the golden age of the genre</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441160/extras/6b98d4d68f989cd5e426cffc30aa6199.avif?t=1704007782\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 About the Game</strong></h2>If you one day receive a mysterious package from the Collector, then you've got to deliver it to its next intended victim or you will be trapped in his nightmarish world forever.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441160/extras/05e996b4f5c3f3f8d7291146b007164d.poster.avif?t=1704007782\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441160/extras/05e996b4f5c3f3f8d7291146b007164d.webm?t=1704007782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441160/extras/05e996b4f5c3f3f8d7291146b007164d.mp4?t=1704007782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Armed solely with a magical flashlight fueled by the ambient light of your surroundings,  you must fend off the encroaching darkness and its horrors at every turn <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441160/extras/449ee2c96cd753c98faaf2fb03e4e446.poster.avif?t=1704007782\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441160/extras/449ee2c96cd753c98faaf2fb03e4e446.webm?t=1704007782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441160/extras/449ee2c96cd753c98faaf2fb03e4e446.mp4?t=1704007782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Will you be able survive and break the curse, or succumb to becoming another prized possession in the Collector's macabre collection?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441160/extras/148cb66633ea242235317aa312642acb.poster.avif?t=1704007782\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441160/extras/148cb66633ea242235317aa312642acb.webm?t=1704007782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441160/extras/148cb66633ea242235317aa312642acb.mp4?t=1704007782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\u25a0 Explore several areas, inspired by real world locations in Taiwan<br><br>\u25a0 Engage in puzzle-solving and inventory management to overcome challenges.<br><br>\u25a0 Fight against enemies, wielding the power of light as your only defense.<br><br>\u25a0 Experience multiple endings and unlockable content as you strive for survival.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441160/extras/b990b19c2f41cbc663efc47c32cae3fa.poster.avif?t=1704007782\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441160/extras/b990b19c2f41cbc663efc47c32cae3fa.webm?t=1704007782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2441160/extras/b990b19c2f41cbc663efc47c32cae3fa.mp4?t=1704007782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
